      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.375,
        "t": 472.49309999999997,
        "r": 218.92499999999998,
        "b": 464.8852008403361
      },
      "content": "Unplug dishwasher or disconnect power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0997",
      "reading_order": 1138,
      "section": "Remove the Heating Element",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.375,
        "t": 459.49309999999997,
        "r": 276.795,
        "b": 441.8852008403361
      },
      "content": "Open the dishwasher door and take out cutlery basket and lower rack."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0998",
      "reading_order": 1139,
      "section": "Remove the Heating Element",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.375,
        "t": 436.49309999999997,
        "r": 286.35499999999996,
        "b": 418.8852008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove dishwasher from installation and lay dishwasher on its back."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0999",
      "reading_order": 1140,
      "section": "Remove the Heating Element",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.375,
        "t": 413.49309999999997,
        "r": 289.8849999999999,
        "b": 395.8852008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove the one (1) screw that attaches base cover to the base. Remove base cover and set aside."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1000",
      "reading_order": 1141,
      "section": "Remove the Heating Element",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.375,
        "t": 390.49309999999997,
        "r": 262.6449999999999,
        "b": 372.8852008403361
      },
      "content": "Disconnect the two (2) pink wires from the heating element terminals (see Figure 1).",
      "hyperlink_hint": true
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1001",
      "reading_order": 1142,
      "section": "Remove the Heating Element",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 706.6469000000001,
        "r": 539.9000000000003,
        "b": 669.0390008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove the nuts and washers that attach the heating element to the bottom of the tub (see Figure 2). NOTE: Sump is removed to show location of heater terminals, nuts and washers.",
      "hyperlink_hint": true
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1002",
      "reading_order": 1143,
      "section": "Remove the Heating Element",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 452.6469,
        "r": 560.2400000000004,
        "b": 435.03900084033614
      },
      "content": "From the inside of the tub, lift the backside of the element and release it from the 2 retainers. See Figure 3.",
      "hyperlink_hint": true
    },
